  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Health Care Project in Eastern Burma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Emergency Health Care Project in Eastern Burma is a component of Assistance to Conflict-affected People, Eastern Burma reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;298,526. It works in the following sector(s): Basic health care, Malaria control, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Health education, Health personnel development.</narrative>
  </description>
